 "assigned_role": "control",
 "description": "The balance loop gains a continuous torque limit of 0.0314 N*m, which caps each driver's continuous output at 0.42 A (0.35 A from the pack). The left driver, which the loop constrains, keeps its base node with no continuous_output_current or continuous_current_draw and no reason given, so the pack's 0.70 A continuous motor draw counts a left-driver figure that the left driver does not carry. (The battery pack also changed and constrains the driver, so that same-domain edge is unwritten too.)",
 "edge": {
  "source": "control.balance_loop",
  "target": "electrical.driver_left"
 },
